Throw a cloud of blinding dust in a radius [1, 1, 1, 2, 2 (TL1-5)] cone. Enemies within will be blinded, as well as having their accuracy reduced by [8, 13, 17, 21, 24 (TL1-5)] and movement speed decreased by [29%, 44%, 54%, 60%, 64% (TL1-5)] for [3, 3, 4, 4, 5 (TL1-5)] turns.

The chance to inflict these effects increase with your Accuracy.
